{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Emisell App Clients and Endpoint Proof API",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "ADR 0018. Registrasi confidential client untuk persiapan OAuth, endpoint proof dan secret lifecycle. Bukan OAuth authorization server/token endpoint. Tetap non-installable. ADR 0022: authoring/distribusi baru hanya shipping/v1. Payment gateway checkout internal Emisell, bukan aplikasi umum. Record payment historis tetap terbaca; reject/suspend/revoke tersedia. Pengajuan/approval/sign/publish dan kesiapan app-client/Testing payment ditolak. Instalasi/RPC payment fixture tidak diubah."
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:8087"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/admin/app-clients": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Daftar identitas app-client dan kesiapan",
        "description": "Sesi admin; Origin/Referer exact http://localhost:4317. Admin dapat membaca; hanya administrator boleh revoke. Tidak boleh registrasi, probe atau memperoleh secret. Baca tidak melakukan probe. Challenge 10 menit; verifikasi HTTPS eksplisit, bukti 24 jam; satu probe per menit/client. Key idempotensi actor-scoped. Retry identik tidak mengungkap secret atau mengirim ulang probe; hasil mengikuti state terkini selama gate release tetap valid. Challenge baru membatalkan bukti/secret lama. Secret eacs_ hash-only 256-bit; rotasi mematikan secret lama, revoke terminal. ClientReady bukan grant, token exchange atau install. ADR 0022: authoring/distribusi baru hanya shipping/v1. Payment gateway checkout internal Emisell, bukan aplikasi umum. Record payment historis tetap terbaca; reject/suspend/revoke tersedia. Pengajuan/approval/sign/publish dan kesiapan app-client/Testing payment ditolak. Instalasi/RPC payment fixture tidak diubah.",
